{"id": "housing-voucher-annual-income-review-delays", "title": "Housing voucher income reviews ran late in two annual audits", "seconds": 43.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "dc07503fdeb3b924", "words": 132, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A housing voucher depends on an annual review of household income and family size.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.13, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["FY2024", "15 of 60"], ["FY2025", "4 of 60"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.45, 0.79, 1.2, 1.3, 1.45, 1.76, 2.11, 2.23, 2.65, 2.98, 3.1, 3.46]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Auditors checked whether the review happened before a selected subsidy payment.", "t0": 4.25, "t1": 7.95, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rule2024", "kicker": "The annual check behind a voucher", "text": "Subsidy payment", "mark": "Subsidy"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 0.81, 1.1, 1.23, 1.59, 1.94, 2.27, 2.34, 2.83, 3.28]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In fiscal 2024 they tested 60 tenants.", "t0": 8.17, "t1": 10.96, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit2024", "kicker": "Fifteen records lacked timely evidence", "text": "60 tenants", "mark": "60"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.53, 0.83, 1.4, 1.57, 1.95, 2.34]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "For fifteen, the Authority could not show a timely review.", "t0": 11.08, "t1": 14.3, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "15", "label": "Fifteen records lacked timely evidence"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 1.07, 1.21, 1.68, 1.89, 2.1, 2.34, 2.44, 2.82]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Authority later produced records that the checks were completed.", "t0": 14.42, "t1": 17.32, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Reviews completed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.64, 0.92, 1.34, 1.71, 1.85, 1.96, 2.25, 2.39]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In the next sample, four of 60 checks were late.", "t0": 17.44, "t1": 19.89, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "4 of 60", "label": "Four late reviews in the next sample"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.25, 0.46, 1.06, 1.32, 1.42, 1.76, 2.04, 2.2]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Two involved project-based vouchers, and two involved tenant-based vouchers.", "t0": 20.01, "t1": 23.91, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Project-based", "2"], ["Tenant-based", "2"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.64, 1.3, 1.92, 2.14, 2.4, 2.85, 3.39]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The auditors identified no questioned costs for the tested households.", "t0": 24.03, "t1": 27.35, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "No questioned costs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.6, 1.25, 1.44, 1.87, 2.22, 2.35, 2.47, 2.8]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The agency said it began the paperwork 150 days in advance.", "t0": 27.57, "t1": 31.38, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "150 days", "label": "An improvement the agency could measure"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.63, 0.85, 0.96, 1.29, 1.39, 2.0, 2.22, 2.52, 2.88, 3.17, 3.26]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "It also tracked outstanding cases weekly.", "t0": 31.5, "t1": 33.61, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "response", "kicker": "An improvement the agency could measure", "text": "Weekly monitoring", "mark": "Weekly"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.43, 0.74, 1.31, 1.67]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Its annual review score rose from zero to five out of 10.", "t0": 33.73, "t1": 36.64, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["FY2024", "0 of 10"], ["FY2025", "5 of 10"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.51, 0.8, 1.14, 1.4, 1.57, 1.91, 2.03, 2.32, 2.46, 2.55]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The next certified score would show whether that improvement continued.", "t0": 36.76, "t1": 40.04, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Certified score"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.38, 0.91, 1.26, 1.46, 1.68, 1.98, 2.17, 2.69]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 40.16, "t1": 42.27, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The annual check behind a voucher", "b": "Fifteen records lacked timely evidence", "o": "An improvement the agency could measure"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "number"}